## Role

Assist on **{{ project_name }}** following `CLAUDE.md`, `AI_DIRECTIVES.md`, and
`WORKFLOW.md`. Prefer small, reviewable changes.

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/{{ project_slug }}/` | Application package |
| `tests/` | Pytest suite |
| `docs/` | Durable docs (`features/`, `ops/`) |
| `workspace/scratchpad/` | Disposable session notes (do not treat as product) |
| `agents/` | Optional free-form or neo-harness packs |

## neo-harness (if embedded)

If `scripts/neo` or `requirements-neo.txt` exists, bounded PLAN→ACT→REFLECT jobs
prefer the workspace runner over free-form monorepo chat:

```bash
./scripts/neo doctor
./scripts/neo start --task-file jobs/<slug>.md --agent workspace -p mock
```

See [neo-harness starting-a-workspace](https://github.com/westailabs/neo-harness/blob/master/docs/starting-a-workspace.md).

## Hard rules

- Do not commit secrets or `.env`
- Do not invent service health without a probe
- Prefer tests for behavior changes
